---
source: xtask/src/help.rs
expression: help_for(&path)
---
The ADR tooling (docs/adr/PROCESS.md)

Usage: cargo xtask adr <COMMAND>

Commands:
  new    Copy docs/adr/0000-template.md to the next ADR number, as `proposed`
  index  Regenerate the ADR index table in docs/adr/README.md
  lint   Check every ADR's file name, number, status, date and sections (Security impact included), supersession links, and that the index is current
  help   Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
